    {
      "_id": "iqpLuEWIqwzcNkFX",
      "_key": "!journal.pages!ciIKIq7hoVokkr0J.iqpLuEWIqwzcNkFX",
      "name": "Storyteller Notes",
      "type": "text",
      "title": {
        "show": true,
        "level": 1
      },
      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<p>The Prince&#39;s foundation owns it. Nadia (@UUID[JournalEntry.rg50DlMYSzgbZeBv]{Nadia Ferro}) feeds here. @UUID[JournalEntry.AeAhHuCNHL9KWVnT]{Wendell Fry} comes in almost every night and writes on napkins (@UUID[JournalEntry.FVBnf3yE87K4BOhh]{Wendell Fry: “Song for the Son of the Fist”}).</p>\n<p>Hunting here is easy (Difficulty 2), but the Club belongs to the Prince: you ask permission or you pay.</p>\n<p>It&#39;s a good place for an improvised social scene or for finding Fry outside Elysium.</p>\n"
      },
